  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.2.0 -- DataBridge.OpenConnectionAsync: an open connection of the configured provider, for work that runs several commands in one transaction (used by SI.WA.Import). Additive, no breaking change. 2.1.0 -- DataBridge: WA_AiSettings support for SI.WA.UI.Core 1.1.0 (AI providers and encrypted API keys moved from appsettings to the database): AiSettings_EnsureSchemaAsync (creates the table if missing, SQL Server and PostgreSQL), AiSettings_GetAllAsync, AiSettings_CountByRoleAsync, AiSettings_InsertAsync, AiSettings_UpdateApiKeyAsync, constant AiSettingsTable. Additive, no breaking change.",
